  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Village_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9d19e2569c0e0e84fa7d123238b2dfc6, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 4621676374010888273
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 192871460864
    m_Localized: "So you\u2019re the one who stopped those skeletons."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 1523485044736
    m_Localized: I need silver, Do u want to help me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 3594712051712
    m_Localized: Do u want to give me de gem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 4076192985088
    m_Localized: Exit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 115128876462080
    m_Localized: They would have breached the gate in minutes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 115357159845888
    m_Localized: "We blocked it\u2026 but it won\u2019t hold much longer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 115485799149568
    m_Localized: "Wait\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 115691542343680
    m_Localized: "That emblem on your cloak\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 115910652784640
    m_Localized: It looks like you bear the mark of the Shadow Hunters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 116250408185856
    m_Localized: "\u2026Suppose so."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 116307995979776
    m_Localized: Shadow Hunters?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 116629107699712
    m_Localized: "Then you\u2019ve arrived at a bad time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 117073221578752
    m_Localized: The last of our kind went out days ago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 117807308664832
    m_Localized: Hunters of the Mist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 118351683186688
    m_Localized: The only ones bold enough to venture beyond the fog.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 118915288592384
    m_Localized: "We had one. He went out days ago\u2026 and never returned."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 119202816520192
    m_Localized: Maybe you can discover what happened to him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 121785606008832
    m_Localized: "One more thing. If you wish to venture beyond\u2026 seek Morran."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 122189051916288
    m_Localized: "He will open the Northern Gate\u2026 if he so chooses."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 122391473221632
    m_Localized: "And\u2026 there\u2019s someone else who can help you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 123001811562496
    m_Localized: "Haldrik. He\u2019s\u2026 peculiar."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 123202752278528
    m_Localized: A little strange, but he knows how to improve gear and tools.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 123343999660032
    m_Localized: Worth seeking out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 129939144241152
    m_Localized: "Ah! I\u2019ve been expecting you!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 130304325513216
    m_Localized: "\u2026or at least one of us."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 130497435463680
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m the head! I make the decisions!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 130782576832512
    m_Localized: "Well, then decide faster\u2014the iron\u2019s cooling!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 130945701703680
    m_Localized: "Quiet, both of you\u2026 he\u2019s watching!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 131108251955200
    m_Localized: "Alright\u2026 never mind. You. Yes, you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 131304285335552
    m_Localized: I need some fresh iron ore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 131478625775616
    m_Localized: "The mines around here are no good anymore\u2026 everything\u2019s
      been corrupted by the Mist."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 131954918354944
    m_Localized: I can help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 131988858662912
    m_Localized: "I\u2019m not interested."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 136758877024256
    m_Localized: Excellent!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 136913336463360
    m_Localized: "But listen\u2026 to get out, you\u2019ll have to go through the
      Northern Gate."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 137488522342400
    m_Localized: "Morran can open it\u2026 yes, the serious guy who\u2019s always
      watching."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 137865548328960
    m_Localized: "Once you\u2019re out, look for the iron ore."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 138050206756864
    m_Localized: "Bring enough, and we can upgrade your gear\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 138187041730560
    m_Localized: "\u2026or at least try, without burning your fingers!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 138442189631488
    m_Localized: "\u2026Hmm. Well, you know where to find me if you change your mind."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 138573634924544
    m_Localized: "Don\u2019t complain when your weapons break\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 140912139759616
    m_Localized: "You shouldn\u2019t be here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141060467126272
    m_Localized: "The Northern Gate leads straight into the Mist. Many leave\u2026
      few return."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141246413205504
    m_Localized: "If you plan to go out\u2026 I\u2019ll be clear."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141338427846656
    m_Localized: "Once I open the gate, I won\u2019t open it again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 141450956828672
    m_Localized: "Find a Return Portal, or we won\u2019t see each other again."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 141548054966272
    m_Localized: "When you\u2019re ready, approach the gate\u2026 and I\u2019ll let
      you pass."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 4621676374010888273
  - m_Id: 165763193827328
    m_Localized: I can feel it spreading through my blood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 165915841327104
    m_Localized: I will not allow it to turn me into one of those things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 166027112017920
    m_Localized: "I\u2019d rather die here\u2026 while I am still myself."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167303161901056
    m_Localized: "\u2026Suppose so."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 167907166842880
    m_Localized: Shadow Hunters?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 169727876460544
    m_Localized: "\u2026Suppose so."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 189028144222208
    m_Localized: Thanks! I'll let you know if i need something more
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 198589290876928
    m_Localized: Thanks! I'll let you know if i need something more
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
